        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cat-list" value="• 정보 수집 (2개): sysCheck, stb_request_info&#10;• 재부팅 (4개): smartReboot, stbRestart, stb_control_restart, stb_control_reset&#10;• 시청 제한 (5개): limitAge, tvLock, tvUnlock, chLock, chUnlock&#10;• 디스플레이 설정 (3개): tvType, hdr, resolution&#10;• 오디오 설정 (2개): audioMode, digitalAudio&#10;• MAC 주소 (1개): getStbMac&#10;• UI/알람 (5개): localUi, cloudUi, standbyMode, zappingAd, morningAlarm&#10;• 네트워크 (7개): channelPlan, freqPlan, defaultGW, syncIp, qamStatus, channelInfo, channelScan&#10;• HDMI/기타 (12개): factoryReset, hdmiCec, autoPowerOn, 채널 관리, 로그 수집 등" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="325" width="690" height="165" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
