        <mxCell id="pagination-total" value="전체 3개 Job (1-3 표시)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=11;fontColor=#6c757d;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="650" y="905" width="350" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dev-notes-bg" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8f9fa;strokeColor=#dee2e6;arcSize=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="50" y="990" width="1500" height="1440" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dev-notes-title" value="📖 개발자 노트 (API 상세 정보)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1010" width="400" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-principle-box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff3cd;strokeColor=#ffc107;arcSize=5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1050" width="1460" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-principle-title" value="⚠️ 와이어프레임 설계 원칙" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1060" width="300" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-principle-content" value="이 와이어프레임은 API 응답에서 직접 제공되는 데이터만 표시합니다.&#10;&#10;제거된 항목:&#10;• 전체 통계 섹션: 모든 Job의 count_by_status를 합산해야 하므로 API가 직접 제공하지 않음&#10;• 필터 상태별 개수: 각 Job의 주요 상태를 판단해야 하므로 프론트엔드 로직 필요&#10;  - 예: &quot;✅ 완료 (0)&quot; → &quot;✅ 완료&quot;로 변경&#10;• 상태 필터 버튼: API에 status 파라미터가 없으므로 완전히 제거&#10;  - API 필터: job_id, work_type, task_id만 지원&#10;  - 유지: total 필드로 알 수 있는 &quot;전체 Job 개수&quot;&#10;&#10;프론트엔드에서 필요 시 각 Job의 count_by_status를 분석하여 통계 및 필터링 구현 가능" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1090" width="1460" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="api-basic-box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dee2e6;arcSize=5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1180" width="1460" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="api-basic-title" value="🔗 API 기본 정보" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1190" width="300" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="api-basic-content" value="엔드포인트: GET /catv/stb/control/results&#10;쿼리 파라미터:&#10;• limit: 조회 개수 (기본 100, 최대 1000)&#10;• offset: 시작 위치 (기본 0, 최대 uint64)&#10;• job_id: Job ID 필터 (선택)&#10;• work_type: 제어 명령 필터 (선택)&#10;• task_id: Task ID 필터 (선택)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Courier New;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1220" width="1460" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="response-structure-box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dee2e6;arcSize=5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1320" width="1460" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="response-structure-title" value="📦 응답 JSON 구조" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1330" width="300" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="response-structure-content" value="{&#10;  &quot;total&quot;: 3,                    // 전체 매칭 Job 개수&#10;  &quot;limit&quot;: 100,                   // 조회 개수&#10;  &quot;offset&quot;: 0,                    // 시작 위치&#10;  &quot;filters&quot;: {                     // 적용된 필터&#10;    &quot;job_id&quot;: &quot;&quot;,&#10;    &quot;work_type&quot;: &quot;&quot;,&#10;    &quot;task_id&quot;: &quot;&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;items&quot;: [                       // Job 목록&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;request_received_at&quot;: &quot;2026-02-12T02:34:52Z&quot;,&#10;      &quot;job_id&quot;: &quot;5c26dadd-c8ca-41ef-9e41-904d7c029fbd&quot;,&#10;      &quot;task_ids&quot;: [&quot;...-0&quot;, &quot;...-1&quot;, &quot;...-2&quot;, &quot;...-3&quot;],&#10;      &quot;work_type&quot;: &quot;stb_request_info&quot;,&#10;      &quot;count_by_status&quot;: {&quot;completed&quot;: 28640, &quot;failed&quot;: 51125, &quot;running&quot;: 1341, &quot;pending&quot;: 0}&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#82b366;fillColor=#d5e8d4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=9;fontFamily=Courier New;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="90" y="1365" width="1420" height="145" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="aggregation-box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dee2e6;arcSize=5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1540" width="1460" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="aggregation-title" value="📊 count_by_status 집계 방식" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1550" width="300" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="aggregation-content" value="ClickHouse 쿼리:&#10;SELECT&#10;  request_received_at, job_id, groupUniqArray(task_id) as task_ids, any(work_type) as work_type,&#10;  sumMap(map(task_status, 1)) as count_by_status&#10;FROM dist_stb_control_job&#10;WHERE [필터 조건]&#10;GROUP BY request_received_at, job_id&#10;ORDER BY request_received_at DESC&#10;LIMIT ? OFFSET ?&#10;&#10;• sumMap 함수: 각 task_status 값을 키로, 개수를 값으로 하는 맵 생성 후 합산&#10;• 결과: {&quot;pending&quot;: N, &quot;running&quot;: N, &quot;completed&quot;: N, &quot;failed&quot;: N}" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=9;fontFamily=Courier New;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1580" width="1460" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="result-code-box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff3cd;strokeColor=#ffc107;arcSize=5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1700" width="1460" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="result-code-title" value="⚠️ result_code 및 실패 케이스 해석" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1710" width="300" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="result-code-content" value="result_code 값:&#10;• &quot;&quot; (빈 문자열): K8s Job 생성 실패 또는 Worker 실행 전&#10;  - task_error_message에 상세 원인 기록 (예: &quot;failed to create K8s job&quot;)&#10;  - 모든 STB가 failed 상태로 처리됨&#10;• &quot;1&quot;: 성공 - STB가 명령을 정상적으로 수행&#10;• &quot;0&quot;: 장비 에러 - wrong parameter, not supported 등&#10;• &quot;-1&quot;: 시스템 에러 - timeout, connection refused, network unreachable 등&#10;&#10;실제 운영 데이터 분석 (2026-02-12):&#10;• Job 2, 3: 전체 실패 (result_code 빈 문자열) → K8s Job 생성 실패로 추정&#10;• Job 1: 혼합 상태 (완료 35.3%, 실패 63.0%, 실행중 1.7%) → 정상 처리 중" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1740" width="1460" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sorting-box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dee2e6;arcSize=5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1850" width="1460" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sorting-title" value="🔍 정렬 및 필터" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
