        <mxCell id="next-step-content" value="특정 Job의 STB별 상세 결과 조회:&#10;GET /catv/stb/control/results/:job_id?limit=1000&amp;offset=0&#10;&#10;필터 옵션:&#10;• cm_mac: CM MAC 주소&#10;• stb_mac: STB MAC 주소&#10;• status: pending, running, completed, failed&#10;• result: &quot;1&quot;, &quot;0&quot;, &quot;-1&quot;, &quot;&quot;&#10;• task_id: Task ID (LIKE 검색)&#10;&#10;→ 각 STB별 result_code, result_message, 실행 시각 등 상세 정보 확인 가능" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Courier New;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
