        <mxCell id="legend-content" value="빈 문자열 (&quot;&quot;): K8s Job 생성 실패 또는 Worker 실행 전  |  1: 성공  |  0: 장비 에러 (wrong parameter 등)  |  -1: 시스템 에러 (timeout, connection refused 등)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1220" width="1460" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dev-notes-bg" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8f9fa;strokeColor=#dee2e6;arcSize=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="50" y="1300" width="1500" height="2040" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dev-notes-title" value="📖 개발자 노트 (API 상세 정보)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1320" width="400" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="api-sequence-box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;arcSize=5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1370" width="1460" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="api-sequence-title" value="🔄 화면 진입 시 API 호출 순서" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1380" width="300" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="api-sequence-content" value="1️⃣ GET /catv/stb/control/results?job_id=XXX (Job 목록 API)&#10;   → count_by_status 획득: {pending, running, completed, failed}&#10;   → 상단 &quot;처리 상태&quot; 섹션의 통계 표시&#10;   → 필터 버튼의 개수 표시 (예: &quot;✅ 완료 (28,640)&quot;)&#10;&#10;2️⃣ GET /catv/stb/control/results/:job_id (Job 상세 API)&#10;   → items 배열 획득: [{task_id, cm_mac_addr, task_status, result_code, ...}, ...]&#10;   → 테이블에 Task 상세 정보 표시&#10;&#10;💡 필터 적용 시:&#10;   - Job 상세 API만 호출 (status, result, MAC 필터)&#10;   - 예: GET /catv/stb/control/results/:job_id?status=failed&amp;result=-1&#10;   - &quot;처리 상태&quot; 섹션의 전체 통계는 변하지 않음 (초기 count_by_status 유지)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Courier New;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1410" width="1460" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="api-basic-box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dee2e6;arcSize=5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1570" width="1460" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="api-basic-title" value="🔗 Job 상세 API (GET /catv/stb/control/results/:job_id)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1580" width="500" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="api-basic-content" value="쿼리 파라미터:&#10;• limit: 조회 개수 (기본 1000, 최대 10000) - DefaultResultsLimit / MaxJobResultsLimit&#10;• offset: 시작 위치 (기본 0, 최대 uint64)&#10;• task_id: Task ID 필터 (정확한 UUID 문자열)&#10;• cm_mac / stb_mac: MAC 주소 필터 (정확히 일치 또는 prefix 검색 &quot;00:11:22*&quot; 지원)&#10;• status: Task 상태 필터 (배열 지원: pending, running, completed, failed)&#10;• result: 결과 코드 필터 (&quot;1&quot;, &quot;0&quot;, &quot;-1&quot;, &quot;&quot;)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Courier New;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1610" width="1460" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="response-box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dee2e6;arcSize=5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1730" width="1460" height="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="response-title" value="📦 응답 JSON 구조" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1740" width="300" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="response-content" value="{&#10;  &quot;job_id&quot;: &quot;5c26dadd-c8ca-41ef-9e41-904d7c029fbd&quot;,&#10;  &quot;total&quot;: 81106,                // 필터 조건에 맞는 전체 Task 수&#10;  &quot;limit&quot;: 1000,                 // 요청한 조회 개수 (echo)&#10;  &quot;offset&quot;: 0,                   // 요청한 시작 위치 (echo)&#10;  &quot;filters&quot;: {                   // 적용된 필터 조건 (echo)&#10;    &quot;task_id&quot;: &quot;&quot;,&#10;    &quot;cm_mac&quot;: &quot;&quot;,&#10;    &quot;stb_mac&quot;: &quot;&quot;,&#10;    &quot;status&quot;: null,              // 배열 가능 [&quot;completed&quot;, &quot;failed&quot;]&#10;    &quot;result&quot;: &quot;&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;items&quot;: [                     // Task 상세 정보&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;task_id&quot;: &quot;5c26dadd-...-0&quot;, &quot;cm_mac_addr&quot;: &quot;84AB1A3431A3&quot;, &quot;stb_mac_addr&quot;: &quot;84AB1A3431A3&quot;,&#10;      &quot;task_status&quot;: &quot;failed&quot;, &quot;result_code&quot;: &quot;-1&quot;, &quot;result_message&quot;: &quot;timed out...&quot;,&#10;      &quot;task_created_at&quot;: &quot;2026-02-12T02:34:52Z&quot;, &quot;task_updated_at&quot;: &quot;2026-02-12T02:36:15Z&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#82b366;fillColor=#d5e8d4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=9;fontFamily=Courier New;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="90" y="1775" width="1420" height="185" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="filter-detail-box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dee2e6;arcSize=5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1990" width="1460" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="filter-detail-title" value="🔍 필터 동작 상세" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="2000" width="300" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="filter-detail-content" value="MAC 주소 prefix 검색:&#10;• Wildcard * 는 MAC 주소 끝에만 사용 가능 (예: &quot;00:03:78:6a:f*&quot;)&#10;• 중간에 * 사용 불가 (예: &quot;00:*:78:6a:f1&quot; ❌)&#10;• 정확한 MAC 주소도 검색 가능 (예: &quot;00:03:78:6a:f1:23&quot;)&#10;&#10;status 배열 지원:&#10;• HTTP Query: ?status=completed&amp;status=failed (여러 번 지정)&#10;• 응답 filters.status: [&quot;completed&quot;, &quot;failed&quot;] (배열)&#10;• 단일 값도 가능: ?status=failed → [&quot;failed&quot;]&#10;&#10;정렬:&#10;• task_created_at ASC (생성 시간 오름차순)&#10;• 가장 먼저 생성된 Task부터 표시" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Courier New;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="2030" width="1460" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="result-code-box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff3cd;strokeColor=#ffc107;arcSize=5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="2190" width="1460" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="result-code-title" value="⚠️ result_code 및 실패 케이스 해석" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="2200" width="300" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="result-code-content" value="result_code 값:&#10;• &quot;&quot; (빈 문자열): K8s Job 생성 실패 또는 Worker 실행 전&#10;  - task_error_message에 상세 원인 기록&#10;  - task_status = &quot;failed&quot;인 경우 K8s 문제 (네트워크 에러 아님)&#10;• &quot;1&quot;: 성공 - STB가 명령을 정상적으로 수행&#10;• &quot;0&quot;: 장비 에러 - wrong parameter, not supported, wrong work type 등&#10;• &quot;-1&quot;: 시스템 에러 - connection timeout, connection refused, network unreachable 등&#10;&#10;실패 패턴:&#10;1. result_code = &quot;-1&quot; + task_error_message = &quot;timed out waiting for the condition&quot;&#10;   → K8s Worker Job 타임아웃 (STB 응답 대기 중 시간 초과)&#10;2. result_code = &quot;-1&quot; + result_message = &quot;connection timeout&quot; / &quot;connection refused&quot;&#10;   → 네트워크 연결 실패 (STB 미응답 또는 네트워크 장애)&#10;3. result_code = &quot;&quot; + task_status = &quot;failed&quot;&#10;   → K8s Job 생성 실패 (인프라 문제)&#10;4. result_code = &quot;0&quot;&#10;   → STB 장비 에러 (잘못된 파라미터, 미지원 명령 등)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="2230" width="1460" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="404-box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dee2e6;arcSize=5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="2400" width="1460" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="404-title" value="🚫 404 응답 조건" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="2410" width="300" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="404-content" value="404 반환 조건:&#10;• total == 0 AND offset == 0 AND filters가 모두 비어있을 때&#10;• Job이 존재하지 않거나 Task가 하나도 없는 경우&#10;&#10;200 OK 반환 (404 아님):&#10;• 필터를 사용한 경우 (hasFilters() == true) 결과가 없어도 200 OK&#10;• total = 0이지만 filters가 있으면 빈 items 배열 반환" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="2440" width="1460" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pagination-detail-box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dee2e6;arcSize=5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="2530" width="1460" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pagination-detail-title" value="📄 페이지네이션 동작" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="2540" width="300" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pagination-detail-content" value="limit 처리:&#10;• 생략 시 기본값 DefaultResultsLimit (1000) 적용&#10;• limit &gt; MaxJobResultsLimit (10000) 요청 시 자동으로 10000으로 제한&#10;&#10;offset 처리:&#10;• 최대값 MaxOffsetValue (math.MaxUint64 = 18,446,744,073,709,551,615)&#10;• 실질적으로 제한 없음&#10;&#10;total 값:&#10;• 필터 조건에 맞는 전체 Task 수&#10;• offset 값과 무관하게 항상 전체 매칭 건수 반환" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Courier New;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="2570" width="1460" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="query-box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;arcSize=5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="2680" width="1460" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="query-title" value="🗄 데이터 조회 방식 (ClickHouse)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="2690" width="300" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="query-content" value="쿼리 방식:&#10;• ClickHouse에서 직접 조회 (집계 없음)&#10;• SELECT task_id, cm_mac_addr, stb_mac_addr, task_status, result_code, result_message,&#10;         task_error_message, task_created_at, task_updated_at, control_executed_at&#10;  FROM dist_stb_control_job&#10;  WHERE job_id = ? AND (필터 조건들)&#10;  ORDER BY task_created_at ASC&#10;  LIMIT ? OFFSET ?&#10;&#10;정렬 기준:&#10;• task_created_at ASC (생성 시간 오름차순)&#10;• 가장 먼저 생성된 Task부터 표시&#10;&#10;필터 조건:&#10;• task_id 정확히 일치 (UUID)&#10;• cm_mac_addr / stb_mac_addr prefix 검색 또는 정확히 일치&#10;• task_status IN [...] (배열)&#10;• result_code 정확히 일치" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=9;fontFamily=Courier New;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="2720" width="1460" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="real-data-box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;arcSize=5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="2860" width="1460" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="real-data-title" value="📈 실제 운영 데이터 분석 (Job: 5c26dadd-...)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="2870" width="400" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="real-data-content" value="Job ID: 5c26dadd-c8ca-41ef-9e41-904d7c029fbd&#10;요청 시각: 2026-02-12 11:34:52 KST&#10;제어 명령: stb_request_info (정보 전송 요청)&#10;&#10;전체 통계:&#10;• 총 81,106대 STB 제어 시도&#10;• ✅ 완료: 28,640대 (35.3%) - result_code = &quot;1&quot; (성공)&#10;• ❌ 실패: 51,125대 (63.0%) - result_code = &quot;-1&quot; (timeout 등)&#10;• 🔄 실행중: 1,341대 (1.7%) - Worker가 현재 처리 중&#10;• ⏳ 대기: 0대 (0%)&#10;• 처리 진행률: 98.3% (running 제외)&#10;&#10;주요 실패 원인:&#10;• &quot;timed out waiting for the condition&quot; - K8s Worker Job 타임아웃&#10;• &quot;connection timeout&quot; / &quot;connection refused&quot; - 네트워크 연결 실패" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="2900" width="1460" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="caution-box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;arcSize=5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="3020" width="1460" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="caution-title" value="⚠️ 주의사항" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="3030" width="300" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="caution-content" value="• task_status = &quot;failed&quot; + result_code = &quot;&quot; → K8s Job 생성 실패 (네트워크 에러 아님)&#10;• task_status = &quot;running&quot; → Worker가 현재 STB와 TCP 통신 중 (result_code 아직 없음)&#10;• task_status = &quot;completed&quot; + result_code = &quot;-1&quot; → 시스템 에러 (네트워크 타임아웃 등)&#10;• task_status = &quot;completed&quot; + result_code = &quot;0&quot; → 장비 에러 (STB가 명령 거부)&#10;• task_status = &quot;completed&quot; + result_code = &quot;1&quot; → 성공&#10;• MAC 주소 prefix 검색 시 * 는 끝에만 사용 가능&#10;• status 필터는 배열로 여러 값 동시 지정 가능 (?status=completed&amp;status=failed)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="3060" width="1460" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="footer" value="GET /catv/stb/control/results/:job_id | 와이어프레임 + 개발자 노트" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#f8f9fa;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#6c757d;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="3160" width="1460" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
